# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local

# Environment — .env.local holds the live Supabase keys and the Claude API
# key for the AI proxy. Never commit it. .env.example is the checked-in
# template that documents which variables are needed.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Editor / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
.DS_Store

# macOS AppleDouble sidecar files. This project lives on a non-HFS external
# volume, so macOS scatters `._*` resource-fork twins next to every file.
# They are not source, and they break linters that try to parse them as UTF-8.
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.vercel

# ── Raw source media ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `Made running/made.mp4` is the 44 MB camera-original of the landing hero.
# The encoded, web-weight derivative that the app actually loads is
# public/video/made-hero.mp4 (4.9 MB) and that one IS committed.
#
# Keeping the original out is not about disk space in the working tree — it
# is about history. Git stores every version of every file forever, and a
# 44 MB binary cannot be delta-compressed, so one commit of it adds 44 MB to
# every clone of this repo for the rest of its life, and removing it later
# means rewriting history and force-pushing. Cheap to add later, expensive
# to take back.
Made running/

# ── Commercial documents ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Client proposal with pricing. This repository is PUBLIC; a priced proposal
# is not source code and does not belong in it. The file stays on disk.
SutekWellness — Made Running Platform Proposal.pdf
*.pdf
